Saramā befriends grieving Sītā and reveals she overheard Rāvaṇa --- Saramā declares Rāma lives and the head was sorcery --- Saramā reports Rāma camped across the sea with Lakṣmaṇa --- Saramā shows Sītā the mustering elephants and chariots and tumult --- Saramā promises Rāma will slay Rāvaṇa and clasp Sītā